A JON mission run has failed. Here is the context:

Mission: {{mission}}
Failure cause: {{failureCause}}
What was tried: {{whatWasTried}}
What failed: {{whatFailed}}
Why it failed: {{whyFailed}}

Heuristic alternatives already computed:
{{heuristicAlternatives}}

Generate up to 5 alternative recovery strategies. You may keep, refine, or replace the heuristic alternatives. Prioritize alternatives that:
1. Are fully automated and safe (no user input required, safetyLevel = "safe")
2. Have high estimated success probability
3. Do not require user intervention

Respond with a JSON object:
{
  "alternatives": [
    {
      "id": "unique_snake_case_id",
      "description": "Clear description of what JON will do (max 300 chars)",
      "approach": "one of: navigate_differently | web_search | manual_intervention | deterministic_fallback | retry | replan | continue | ask_user | public_data_fallback | other",
      "requiresApproval": false,
      "requiresUserInput": false,
      "safetyLevel": "safe",
      "estimatedSuccessProbability": 0.75,
      "rationale": "Why this alternative is likely to work (max 200 chars)"
    }
  ]
}
